── SYNTAX ERROR ───────────── E0100_type_arguments_after_colons.lt:2:22  [E0100]

Stilt gives no type arguments in an expression: an annotation gives them:

  2 │   let ys = [1, 2].map::<i64>(|x| x * 2)
    │                      ^

Type arguments are inferred, or given by an annotation, as `let xs: List<i64> =
…`.

To fix it, delete the type arguments:

  2 │   let ys = [1, 2].map::<i64>(|x| x * 2)
    │                      -------
